{
  "slug": "design",
  "name": "Design",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Accelerate design workflows — critique, design system management, UX writing, accessibility audits, research synthesis, and dev handoff. From exploration to pixel-perfect specs.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **9 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `accessibility-review` (Run a WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility audit on a design or page), `design-critique` (Get structured design feedback on usability, hierarchy, and consistency), `design-handoff` (Generate developer handoff specs from a design), `design-system` (Audit, document, or extend your design system), `research-synthesis` (Synthesize user research into themes, insights, and recommendations), `user-research` (Plan, conduct, and synthesize user research), `ux-copy` (Write or review UX copy — microcopy, error messages, empty states, CTAs)\n- **MCP servers** (9): `slack`, `figma`, `linear`, `asana`, `atlassian`, `notion`, `intercom`, `google calendar`, and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install design@knowledge-work-plugins` from `anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins` (`design`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
